[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここにいたのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is where you've been."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ユナさんも案外暇だねー。\n私なんかを探しに来てくれたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You must have quite a bit of free time, Juna. Coming all this way to find little old me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "茶化すな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stop deflecting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……戻らなくていいのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Shouldn't you be elsewhere?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくはないよ。でも、もうちょっと時間を置きたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I should, but I just need a little more time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たちがどのような仲か、詳しくは知らないが、\n大事な友なのだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know the details of your relationship, but she seems to be an important friend to you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まあね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You could say that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私が親と上手くいってないって話、前したでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Remember when I told you that I don't get along with my parents?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ある時、「日影の会」っていう……なんて言うのかな、\n孤児院みたいなところに世話になったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At one point, I ended up at this place called the Sunshine Society... it was like an orphanage, I guess."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケと初めて会ったのはその時でさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's where I first met Flocke."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "孤児院ということは、彼女の両親は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An orphanage? So her parents are..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、健在ではあるよ。ただ、放任主義っていうか……\nあんま教育に熱心じゃない親でさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, they're still around. They just weren't exactly... enthusiastic about parenting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "娘を施設に預けたり、地元を離れて一人暮らし\nさせたり。フロッケが病気がちなの知っててだよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They left her at the facility, then later had her live alone away from home. All while knowing she was sickly. Can you believe that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……ひどい話だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's... terrible."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私とは別の意味で、親と上手くいってないんだ、\nあの子は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She doesn't get along with her parents either, just for different reasons than me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だからかな。あの子に対しては、\nちょっと過保護になっちゃうんだよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe that's why I'm so overprotective of her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……気持ちは理解できる。\n単なる学友ではなく、家族のような存在なのだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I think I understand. She's more like family to you than just a classmate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "家族……そうかもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Family, huh? Maybe you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、フロッケの頑張りたいって気持ちも分かるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I also understand her desire to push herself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "身体が弱いせいで、やりたいことがやれなかった。\nそんなこともしょっちゅうあったから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because of her weak constitution, she's had to give up on things she wanted to do so many times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行動が制約されていた反動、ということか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it's like she's overcompensating now because she was restricted all this while?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。私だって、フロッケの夢をできるだけ\n尊重してあげたい気持ちはある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. I want to be mindful of Flocke's aspirations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもさ……やっぱり、無理はしてほしくないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still... I don't want her pushing herself too hard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……実行委員としても、\n生徒の体調は第一だと考えている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...As a committee member, I believe students' health comes first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "可能であれば、人員のサポートを\n斡旋したいところだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If possible, I'd like to arrange some additional support personnel, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無理だよ。内容が専門的すぎる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That won't work. Our exhibit is too specialized."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……だろうな。力になれず申し訳ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I thought as much. I'm sorry I couldn't be of more help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナさんが謝ることじゃないよ。\nこれは私たちの問題だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's not on you, Juna. This is our problem to solve."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、どうする？\n文化祭本番まであまり時間はないが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what will you do? There isn't much time left until the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "解決策は……１つ、ある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's... one solution."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケの分まで、私が無理するしかない。\nいい加減、逃げるのはやめだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll have to push myself harder to cover Flocke's part too. It's about time I stopped running away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]